Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:57.44,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}I want my feelings to join yours… to reach you…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.54,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And... there. Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:10.21,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Saturdays are so relaxing since you've taken over cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:11.92,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:13.17,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Tastes great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:15.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot to mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.05,0:01:20.56,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur4\fnEPSON 正楷書体Ｍ\fs38\b1\bord1\fscy110\t(\fscx90\fscy100)\c&HFCFCFF&\3c&HFCFCFF&\t(30,580,\blur1\c&H5A829A&\3c&H264256&)\move(960,263,960,292)}Closed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:20.56,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,we never got to eat ramen after school that other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:28.06,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshida-san seemed really disappointed...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:38.03,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...but personally, I had fun, since I got to hear about her\N obsession with ramen when we stopped for some tea instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.07,0:01:41.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yano-san... Yoshida-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:20.56,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Oh, no!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:21.81,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I totally forgot it was closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.31,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I was ready to fill myself up with ramen, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:28.06,Default-alt,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}You come all the time and can't even remember when it closes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:31.23,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I don't like that "light" stuff when it comes to ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:33.65,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}None of that healthy stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:44.33,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Curry for dinner tonight, Sawako?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:49.04,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! Curry for dinner tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.63,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:54.38,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, you've reached the Kuronumas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:55.92,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I... guess I'm being ignored...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:01:59.18,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sawako!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.14,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You have a call from a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:07.27,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:09.52,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We're going out to eat ramen tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:11.36,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,A bit pushy, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:13.48,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We have to make up for last time when it was closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:19.86,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,D-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Do you mind if I go out to eat ramen with some friends tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:24.79,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,"Friends"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:27.58,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,O-Of course! Come on, you have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.58,0:02:30.21,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh, but I haven't served the curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:32.46,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I can do that myself! Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:34.84,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Invite them over next time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:35.80,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:40.30,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,She's going out for dinner with friends, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:43.43,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she {\i1}did{\i0\fscx30} {\r} say she's been having fun recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:47.48,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I think of it, she came home a little late the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:50.02,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are her friends boys or girls?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.02,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.02,0:02:57.03,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnCrayonAL\fs120\blur7\bord8\c&HD6EEF3&\1a&11&\3c&H44B5C1&\pos(960,720)}saturday night
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:03.53,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:08.04,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This will be my first time eating ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:13.83,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, we don't know your cellphone number yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:14.54,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:16.42,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I don't have a cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:17.84,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:19.05,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:22.18,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I never really felt the need to get one...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:24.05,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well... you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:28.18,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Well... if you ever do get one, let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:31.27,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnCalibri\b1\fs55\bord2\frx15\fry-15\frz10\fax-0.05\c&H82A0FB&\3c&H7E93EE&\pos(1136,776)}Ram{\fax-0.1}en
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:31.27,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.15,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,How's it going, Chizu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:34.69,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You brought over some friends tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:36.94,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, pops! Give us a discount, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:39.65,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I can never turn you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:41.65,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:43.07,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I've always wanted you to try out the ramen here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:44.20,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It's amazing, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:45.87,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Can I get the usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:46.95,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:47.91,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:49.37,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I recommend miso ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Then I'll order that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:53.21,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Can I get shouyu ramen, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:55.54,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I just recommended miso!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:56.88,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I had that last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:00.84,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,They're out of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:03.88,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:06.97,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You're supposed to switch it before the customer notices!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:09.85,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I feel as though I just saw Sanada-kun here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.81,Default-alt,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,We're busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.89,0:04:11.23,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,It {\i1}is{\i0\fscx30} {\r} Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:13.77,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,His family owns this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:14.81,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:16.98,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Your order's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:22.49,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You won't be able to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:26.49,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\fnDomFortress Casual\fs110\bord5\fscy115\3c&H343867&\pos(976,327)}Ramen Tooruryuken
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.49,0:04:26.49,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\fnDomFortress Casual\fs110\bord2.5\fscy115\c&H2F3852&\3c&H252F42&\pos(976,327)}Ramen Tooruryuken
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:25.24,Default,All,0000,0000,0000,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:27.99,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so full!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:30.49,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You really serve the best ramen in town, pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:34.21,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! And it tasted better because\N I was able to enjoy it with my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.21,0:04:36.50,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we'll be upstairs then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:38.92,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. Enjoy your stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:39.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:41.46,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:43.63,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Remind me whose house this is again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:44.59,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Ryu's. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:47.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,A-Am I allowed to come up, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:51.35,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Of course! Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:59.06,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshida-san and Sanada-kun must be really close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:01.65,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, no need to sit so formally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:04.45,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me for just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:07.36,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:10.24,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She's so popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:11.87,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,What, right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:16.79,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sorry. I'm hanging out with some friends tonight, so I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:19.67,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? They're girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:21.00,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Could you two say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:23.26,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,M-Miso ramen is the b-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:23.26,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hoichi was a-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:24.76,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.13,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:28.22,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I'll text you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:29.14,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.01,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.68,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Well... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:34.18,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:36.77,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Your current boyfriend is in college, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:38.27,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Please leave out the "current".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:41.27,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-She's so mature!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:43.07,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:47.86,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You'll understand the dazzling world of grownups one day, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.41,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,D-Dazzling?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:51.28,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You, too, Chizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:56.04,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You keep saying you're a grownup, but\N can you beat up ninety-nine guys like I can?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:06:00.00,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,That's kind of a weird number, isn't it? Ninety-nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.00,0:06:02.55,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It isn't weird; it's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:07.51,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Why not a hundred, then? Who was the hundredth guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:11.14,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:15.85,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Congrats on ending her spree, Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:16.35,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:19.02,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Did you really have to walk in at this exact moment?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:20.69,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,It's my room, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:22.65,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:23.90,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:28.74,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That you two... are dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:38.16,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:40.71,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:45.09,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you at least confirm or deny, Ryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:45.75,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:47.05,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Don't confirm it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:48.13,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:51.80,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Chizuru and I are like brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:54.35,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Hang on! Who's the older brother, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:56.77,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Shouldn't you be more concerned about him calling you a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:56.02,Default-alt,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.23,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Your birthday's after mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.93,0:07:01.81,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have any siblings, so I'm really jealous...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.81,0:07:03.48,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I-I think you're missing the point, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:08.03,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:13.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,A lively atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:17.12,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The friends I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:26.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... really allowed to be with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:33.22,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, why not call Kazehaya over, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:35.10,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:38.31,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We can't let Ryu enjoy this harem all by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.31,0:07:39.10,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:41.06,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,"Harem"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:44.44,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You must feel out of place, too, being the only guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:46.15,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Give me your phone, Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:47.57,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako, why don't you call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:48.44,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:51.82,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:53.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:54.41,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,R-Really? Is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:07:57.49,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I don't see why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:07:59.20,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, just call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:03.21,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be expecting to talk to Ryu, but then he'll\N find himself talking to a girl! It'll give him a scare!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:03.25,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(973.62,35.24)\fscx93\t(-39,60,\fscx94)\fscy100\t(-85,14,\fscy101)\an1\blur1.5\fnCalibri\fs60\c&HA3806B&}Shota
