Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:03.33,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(964.27,48.44)\fscx94\t(-18,81,\fscx95)\fscy101\t(-71,28,\fscy102)\an1\blur1.5\fnCalibri\fs60\c&HA3806B&}Shota
