Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:11.01,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm so nervous...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:14.09,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:16.01,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya picks up right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:18.26,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,"Right away"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:20.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That makes me even more nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:24.23,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Tell him, "We're having a blast, so come over ASAP."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:27.36,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Say, "Ryu's all lonely by himself! Please, come!"
