Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.49,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...I do want him to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:50.50,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Your phone's ringing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:52.05,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it, Shota?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:53.09,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:54.63,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:55.97,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.93,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Let me talk to Ryu, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:57.93,Default-alt,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:08:59.93,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:00.43,Default-alt,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Ryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:04.48,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-Is this Kazehaya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.10,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This is Kuronuma speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:08.73,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Ryu! Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:11.28,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kuro- Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:12.74,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,But this is Ryu's-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:13.28,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:15.32,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.57,0:09:18.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... at Sanada-kun's place right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.99,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it would surprise him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:20.74,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Ryu's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:26.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I went out for ramen with Yano-san\N and Yoshida-san, and now we're all...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:32.92,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,W-We're all hanging out and having a great time, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:38.05,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I just thought that it would be more fun if you were around...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:41.22,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right there on my bike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:45.27,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,H-He said he's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.27,0:09:46.14,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:49.15,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You... were really having that much fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:09.58,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,This is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.25,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:15.46,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You three were in the same class during middle school, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:16.92,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,For our last two years, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:19.89,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Now where's Ryu and Kazehaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:23.39,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,H-He hasn't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:27.77,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,He's looked the same for as long as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.85,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm still growing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:33.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.36,0:10:37.49,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This is a picture of Kazehaya-kun when he was in middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:41.91,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,So this is "Everyone's Kazehaya-kun"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:43.08,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,He looks a little young.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:43.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,His hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:45.91,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, he was on the baseball team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:48.41,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I guess this was taken after his hair grew from the buzzcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.41,0:10:51.83,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,But Ryu has a buzzcut all year, whether it's baseball season or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:52.92,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,It's convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:54.84,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,See? This is the way he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:10:59.63,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Shota's really good at baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.63,0:11:03.64,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Pin was really disappointed when he said he\N wasn't going to join the baseball team in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:07.31,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This is a side of Kazehaya-kun I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:10.94,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what he was like in middle school?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.27,0:11:14.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he studied really hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:17.73,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...and practiced baseball a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:21.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could have seen him play.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.53,0:11:22.91,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,But you can, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:25.58,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,The athletic festival's almost here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:27.91,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya'll probably join you guys in the softball game, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:28.70,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:29.96,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:34.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But instead... I get to see the current Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.21,0:11:40.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be able to take pictures like these with\N everyone and have lots of experiences from now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:46.05,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's the athletic festival, field trip, and many more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.02,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:50.48,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:52.81,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fun. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:54.90,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be able to eat a lot of good stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:55.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:12:00.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be able to have fun with everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:01.65,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:03.99,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:06.24,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You know Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:09.45,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She helped me pick up some printouts the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:10.91,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:13.08,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that look on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:14.58,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,No particular reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:17.17,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,She seems like the type of girl who's pretty popular with the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:18.30,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,She totally is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:21.17,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think of her, Ryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:24.51,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Not really my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:27.55,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You've got a type, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:29.31,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Then what about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:35.77,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:39.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I like you, too, Sanada-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:44.61,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,And what about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.41,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,L-Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:49.16,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:50.91,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You scared me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:54.16,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Then what about Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:00.25,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,L-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:02.38,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,"L-"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:06.39,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Love... I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.05,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.05,0:13:10.51,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think her "love" for him is the same as her "love" for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.51,0:13:12.64,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:14.60,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if she understands herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:17.15,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:19.73,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako! That's-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:21.28,Default-alt,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Come on. Leave her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.57,0:13:26.78,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,One must climb the stairway to\N adulthood with one's own feet, step by step.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:30.28,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why it sounds dirty when you say it, Yano-chin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:38.33,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:39.75,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,A large bowl of miso ramen, if you will!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:41.46,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, Pin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:44.26,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:49.59,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Pin always complicates things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:50.80,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:56.31,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I think about it, isn't Kazehaya's hair long compared to the other guys on the baseball team?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:59.60,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, his hair grows really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:03.32,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,They say hair grows fast on perverted, emo guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:07.24,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'm neither perverted nor emo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:08.91,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You scared me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:11.91,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that opening statement?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:17.54,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,N-Nothing... out of the ordinary...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:19.54,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:22.04,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,It would be funnier if you said, "I'm a huge pervert!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:25.05,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'm normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:32.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He's a boy, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:36.06,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako's sitting there laughing at you, Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.06,0:14:38.94,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Don't laugh at me, Kuronuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:43.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, I wasn't making fun of you or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:43.52,Default-alt,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:47.11,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Laugh all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.03,0:14:55.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My... heart is beating faster than usual...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:59.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's because we're closer than we are in our seats in class?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:03.96,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:05.75,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,No, Sawako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.25,0:15:07.63,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Could you come here for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:09.38,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sit next to Chizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:11.09,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:13.51,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:14.85,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Right down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:15.81,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:19.60,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,This is so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:20.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:24.56,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,So cuddly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:27.98,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You're so soft, Sawako!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.98,0:15:30.11,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You really feel like a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:33.87,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,The prince looks really troubled!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:37.33,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I think I discovered something {\i1}really{\i0\fscx30} {\r} interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:49.63,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Playtime's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:51.47,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of here, you pest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:55.51,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you kids go home, empty your diapers, and go to bed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.10,0:15:58.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,W-W-Why is Arai-sensei here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:01.18,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,C-Could it be that someone reported us for being too loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:03.52,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it, Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:10.65,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,This guy's dad used to coach my little league\N baseball team, so I've known them since they were brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:14.53,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Not to mention how you're a frequenter at\N Ryu's place and you treat this place like you own it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:16.24,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:18.24,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't know that, right, Sawako?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:20.45,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Is it okay to be hanging out with her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.45,0:16:25.21,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,I saw a bunch of tiny old men after staring into her eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:27.96,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:31.47,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's a tiny old man at my house, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:31.47,Default-alt,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Hi...
