Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:33.59,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.59,0:16:36.85,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Have you ever been petrified before, Pin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:37.97,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:39.93,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,All the time, when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.93,0:16:41.73,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,I still do every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.73,0:16:45.10,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Do you ever hear things moving\N around in your room when you get petrified?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:47.40,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah! My place is really old!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:49.52,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,I hear creaking at night when I'm asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:50.32,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:52.24,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's just that you're the one who can see ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:56.82,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Now that you bring it up, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:17:01.50,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,My body felt heavy last night, and I couldn't sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:02.87,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:08.29,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It may be good for you to take a salt bath before going to bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:10.13,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Purifying salt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:13.26,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It'll warm your body up, making it easier to fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:17.26,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:19.26,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,...an exorcist?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:21.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if that'll be helpful-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.93,0:17:23.52,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:26.10,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever! Just go home already, Pin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:27.15,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:28.27,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't {\i1}you{\i0\fscx30} {\r} go home?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:30.69,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost 9pm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.69,0:17:32.53,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,And {\i1}now{\i0\fscx30} {\r} you start acting like a teacher?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.40,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,These guys are idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:32.53,Default-alt,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:33.28,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:34.74,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,It's time for you kids to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:35.49,Default-alt,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's about time for us to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:38.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:40.91,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...he even makes faces like these...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.49,0:17:44.25,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I had so much fun tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:49.00,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I did, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:53.59,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,There'll be a lot more chances to have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:58.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:03.27,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Spending Saturday night with friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:05.31,Default,All,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for letting us stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:09.85,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It was hard to believe that I was really with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:13.36,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm also headed that way.\N I need to stop by the convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:17.86,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My heart's beating so fast, but it feels so comfortable...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:19.91,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Take good care of her, gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:21.87,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Go for it, gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:23.49,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Those two are seriously annoying...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:28.00,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's smiling; that made me so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:40.22,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,There'll be a lot more chances to have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:45.47,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, see ya, Chizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.47,0:18:46.93,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Bye, Yano-chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:53.23,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,W-Why are you headed this way, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:54.44,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?! My place is this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:56.57,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You're annoying! Keep your distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.57,0:18:58.65,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! It's scary to walk alone at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.65,0:19:03.12,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess I'll go home and take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.12,0:19:07.29,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah! So, tell me. What exactly {\i1}is{\i0\fscx30} {\r} your type?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:09.21,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,My type?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:12.67,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You said Kurumi wasn't your type, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:13.42,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:16.38,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I guess... a girl who's simple-minded and dense?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.76,0:19:19.55,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You've got some weird taste...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:20.47,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:22.43,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,A girl who's simple-minded and dense?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:24.72,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,So someone who's like Sadako, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.35,0:19:27.93,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,You know, you really didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.31,0:19:30.06,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I already knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:32.40,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,K-Knew what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:39.74,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,You came over to let me know that you three had made up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.03,0:19:45.03,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:50.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My heart's beating fast, even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:53.54,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I had so much fun tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:59.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... really glad I chose to go to this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:03.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The school where everyone is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:08.97,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,That includes me, too... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.97,0:20:10.31,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,O-Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:14.98,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You changed my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:20.74,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,That's a bit of an overstatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.57,0:20:25.20,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I just felt like pouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:26.74,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,P-Pout?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.41,0:20:29.45,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just pulling your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:33.50,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,The truth is, I wanted to hear you\N say it so I could put my mind at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:39.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,By seeing his middle school pictures...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:42.22,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...a new expression that I'd never seen before...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.59,0:20:47.39,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...I feel as though I was able to peek at a side of\N Kazehaya-kun that was completely unknown to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:50.81,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,For some reason, it makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:55.81,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So Kazehaya-kun, what did you\N need to buy at the convenience store?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:04.57,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.57,0:21:06.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.53,0:21:10.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Surely, I'll get to see even more expressions from now on.
